# Backlight
## Kinetic KTZ8866 (Xiaomi Mi Pad 5 Pro, elish)
on early-boot
    chown system system /sys/class/backlight/ktz8866-backlight/brightness
    chown system system /sys/class/backlight/ktz8866-backlight/max_brightness
